      "difficulty": "Beginner",
      "description": "Point out objects from each of your senses to anchor yourself in the present moment.\n\n---\n**Clinical Purpose:** Ground attention out of cognitive threat loops into safety of local environment.\n**Suitable Moods:** Panicked, Anxious, Disconnected\n**Suitable Mental Health Conditions:** Panic Attacks, Post-Traumatic Flashbacks\n**Scientific Benefits:** Rapidly reduces acute anxiety and stops derealization.\n**Contraindications/Precautions:** None.\n**Setting:** Both\n**Format:** Individual\n**Equipment Required:** None\n**Scientific Rationale:** Forcing sensory identification engages external perception systems, inhibiting worry loops.\n**Evidence Level:** Level 4",
